          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"contact.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\" />\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\" />\\n  <title>Connect | {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Reach {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}} — whole-person care, thoughtful listening, and events to deepen wellness.\\\" />\\n  <style>\\n    :root{\\n      --bg:#0f1724; --card:#0b1220; --muted:#9aa4b2; --accent:#88c7a5; --glass: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);\\n      --radius:14px; --maxw:980px; --gap:20px; font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial;\\n    }\\n    html,body{height:100%;}\\n    body{\\n      margin:0; background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(12,16,22,1) 0%, rgba(6,10,14,1) 100%); color:#e6eef3; -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased; -moz-osx-font-smoothing:grayscale;\\n      display:flex; align-items:flex-start; justify-content:center; padding:36px 18px; box-sizing:border-box;\\n    }\\n    .wrap{width:100%; max-width:var(--maxw);}\\n    nav{display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; margin-bottom:20px}\\n    .brand{display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:center}\\n    .logo{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:10px; background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),#6aa3e8); display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.5)}\\n    .logo svg{width:36px;height:36px; fill:#08262a}\\n    .brand h1{font-size:14px;margin:0;letter-spacing:0.6px}\\n    .brand p{margin:0;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}\\n    .links{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center}\\n    .links a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;font-size:13px;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:10px}\\n    .links a.active{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);color:#fff}\\n\\n    header.hero{position:relative;padding:28px;border-radius:var(--radius);overflow:hidden;background:linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(12,18,24,0.6), rgba(6,10,14,0.6));box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.02), 0 8px 30px rgba(2,6,10,0.6);margin-bottom:18px}\\n    header.hero .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 360px;gap:22px;align-items:start}\\n    .hero-copy h2{margin:0;font-size:22px;letter-spacing:0.2px}\\n    .hero-copy p{color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5}\\n    .cta-row{display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:18px}\\n    .btn{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#6aa3e8);border:none;color:#05221c;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:12px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;text-decoration:none}\\n    .btn.ghost{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);color:var(--muted)}\\n\\n    .panel{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),transparent);border-radius:12px;padding:14px;backdrop-filter: blur(6px);box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.45)}\\n    form.field-grid{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}\\n    input, textarea, select{border-radius:10px;padding:10px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);background:var(--glass);color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}\\n    textarea{min-height:96px;resize:vertical}\\n    .small{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}\\n\\n    section.split{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 340px;gap:22px;margin-bottom:18px}\\n    .card{padding:16px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.01), transparent);}\\n    h3{margin-top:0}\\n    ul.pillars{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:10px 0 0 0;display:grid;gap:8px}\\n    ul.pillars li{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);padding:10px;border-radius:10px;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}\\n\\n    .myth-truth{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}\\n    .mt{padding:12px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,0,80,0.02), transparent);}\\n    .mt h4{margin:0 0 6px 0;font-size:13px}\\n    .mt p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}\\n\\n    .cases{display:grid;gap:10px}\\n    .case{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start}\\n    .case .dot{width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#3a8fb0,#8bd6b6);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700}\\n    .case p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}\\n\\n    .faq{display:grid;gap:8px}\\n    .faq details{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);padding:12px;border-radius:10px;color:var(--muted)}\\n    footer.cta{margin-top:18px;padding:18px;border-radius:var(--radius);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;background:linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(13,18,22,0.4), rgba(6,10,14,0.4));}\\n\\n    /* responsive */\\n    @media (max-width:880px){\\n      header.hero .grid, section.split{grid-template-columns:1fr;}\\n      .links{display:none}\\n    }\\n\\n    /* background pattern: inline SVG fallback if external asset missing */\\n    .bg-pattern{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:-1;opacity:0.12;pointer-events:none}\\n    .sr-only{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;padding:0;margin:-1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0 0 0 0);white-space:nowrap;border:0}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <svg class=\\\"bg-pattern\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" height=\\\"100%\\\" preserveAspectRatio=\\\"none\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n    <defs>\\n      <linearGradient id=\\\"g1\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\"><stop offset=\\\"0\\\" stop-color=\\\"#073642\\\" stop-opacity=\\\"0.8\\\"/><stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"#073a28\\\" stop-opacity=\\\"0.6\\\"/></linearGradient>\\n      <pattern id=\\\"p1\\\" width=\\\"40\\\" height=\\\"40\\\" patternUnits=\\\"userSpaceOnUse\\\">\\n        <rect width=\\\"40\\\" height=\\\"40\\\" fill=\\\"url(#g1)\\\" />\\n        <path d=\\\"M0 20 L20 0 M20 40 L40 20\\\" stroke=\\\"#0b2f2a\\\" stroke-width=\\\"0.6\\\"/>\\n      </pattern>\\n    </defs>\\n    <rect width=\\\"100%\\\" height=\\\"100%\\\" fill=\\\"url(#p1)\\\" />\\n  </svg>\\n\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\" role=\\\"main\\\">\\n    <nav aria-label=\\\"Primary navigation\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"brand\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"logo\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n          <svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path d=\\\"M3 12C3 7 7 3 12 3s9 4 9 9-4 9-9 9S3 17 3 12z\\\"></path></svg>\\n        </div>\\n        <div>\\n          <h1>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</h1>\\n          <p>{{TAGLINE}}</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"links\\\">\\n        <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"services.html\\\">Offerings</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"conditions.html\\\">Concerns</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"approach.html\\\">Flow</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"pricing.html\\\">Investment</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"about.html\\\">About</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"book.html\\\">Plan</a>\\n        <a class=\\\"active\\\" href=\\\"contact.html\\\">Connect</a>\\n      </div>\\n    </nav>\\n\\n    <header class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"grid\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"hero-copy\\\">\\n          <h2>Let’s meet the whole you — curious, careful, and kind.</h2>\\n          <p>Reach out to inquire about appointments, workshops, or a monthly series of guided sessions. Conversations begin with listening; care grows in rhythm. Use the form to share a little about what brings you here.</p>\\n          <div class=\\\"cta-row\\\">\\n            <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n            <a class=\\\"btn ghost\\\" href=\\\"book.html\\\">Schedule a visit</a>\\n          </div>\\n          <p class=\\\"small\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">Phone: <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none\\\">{{PHONE}}</a> • Email: <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a></p>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <aside>\\n          <div class=\\\"panel\\\">\\n            <strong style=\\\"display:block\\\">Quick connect</strong>\\n            <p class=\\\"small\\\">A short note is fine — share your priority, availability, and whether you'd like to be considered for an upcoming series or workshop.</p>\\n            <form id=\\\"contactForm\\\" class=\\\"field-grid\\\" novalidate>\\n              <label class=\\\"small\\\">Name<input name=\\\"name\\\" type=\\\"text\\\" placeholder=\\\"Your name\\\" required></label>\\n              <label class=\\\"small\\\">Email<input name=\\\"email\\\" type=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"you@domain.com\\\" required></label>\\n              <label class=\\\"small\\\">Phone<input name=\\\"phone\\\" type=\\\"tel\\\" placeholder=\\\"Optional\\\"></label>\\n              <label class=\\\"small\\\">Interested in<select name=\\\"interest\\\"><option value=\\\"consult\\\">Consult & care</option><option value=\\\"series\\\">Series / workshops</option><option value=\\\"lab\\\">Educational labs</option></select></label>\\n              <label class=\\\"small\\\">Message<textarea name=\\\"message\\\" placeholder=\\\"A few sentences about what's brought you here\\\"></textarea></label>\\n              <label style=\\\"font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)\\\"><input type=\\\"checkbox\\\" name=\\\"consent\\\"> I consent to receive replies and occasional event updates.</label>\\n              <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:8px\\\">\\n                <button class=\\\"btn\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\">Send</button>\\n                <button class=\\\"btn ghost\\\" type=\\\"button\\\" id=\\\"clearBtn\\\">Clear</button>\\n              </div>\\n              <p id=\\\"formMsg\\\" class=\\\"small\\\" style=\\\"margin:6px 0 0 0;color:var(--muted)\\\"></p>\\n            </form>\\n          </div>\\n        </aside>\\n      </div>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"split\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <h3>Myth and truth</h3>\\n          <p class=\\\"small\\\">Holistic care is sometimes mistaken for quick fixes. Below are common misunderstandings and what to really expect.</p>\\n          <div class=\\\"myth-truth\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"mt\\\">\\n              <h4>Myth</h4>\\n              <p>No single pill or ritual will ‘fix’ everything instantly.</p>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"mt\\\">\\n              <h4>Truth</h4>\\n              <p>Care is an unfolding conversation. We focus on education, lifestyle supports, and coordinated plans tailored to you — with respect for evidence and limits.</p>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n          <h3>Pillars of our approach</h3>\\n          <ul class=\\\"pillars\\\">\\n            <li>Listening first: your story guides the plan.</li>\\n            <li>Whole-systems thinking: mind, body, environment.</li>\\n            <li>Evidence-informed options and gentle experimentation.</li>\\n            <li>Practical tools: sleep, stress, digestion support.</li>\\n            <li>Community learning: workshops & series to deepen skills.</li>\\n          </ul>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n          <h3>Case notes — illustrated in brief</h3>\\n          <div class=\\\"cases\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"false\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"case\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"dot\\\">A</div>\\n              <div>\\n                <p class=\\\"small\\\"><strong>Anonymous</strong> — Began with chronic sleep disruption. Through paced adjustments, evening routines, and a short coaching series, sleep stabilized. This is educational, not guaranteed.</p>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <div class=\\\"case\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"dot\\\">B</div>\\n              <div>\\n                <p class=\\\"small\\\"><strong>Anonymous</strong> — A client with digestive sensitivity learned small dietary experiments, breath work, and pacing. Symptoms reduced and quality of life improved with consistent steps and follow-up.</p>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <aside>\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <h3>Upcoming series & events</h3>\\n          <p class=\\\"small\\\">Join a focused 6-week series on stress resilience or a community evening on mindful digestion. Space is limited; registering helps us plan meaningfully.</p>\\n          <ul class=\\\"pillars\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\">\\n            <li><strong>Resilience Series</strong> — 6 weekly sessions. Practical tools + group reflection.</li>\\n            <li><strong>Evening Workshop</strong> — Micro-lab on sleep rhythms, hands-on practice.</li>\\n            <li><strong>Open Q&amp;A</strong> — Monthly community conversation.</li>\\n          </ul>\\n          <p class=\\\"small\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:10px;color:var(--muted)\\\">Note: workshops are educational. They are not a substitute for medical care. If you have urgent medical needs, contact your provider.</p>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n          <h3>FAQ</h3>\\n          <div class=\\\"faq\\\">\\n            <details>\\n              <summary>What should I expect in a first visit?</summary>\\n              <p class=\\\"small\\\">An intake focused on history, current concerns, and priorities. We discuss options, timelines, and whether labs or collaborations are educationally appropriate.</p>\\n            </details>\\n\\n            <details>\\n              <summary>Do you order labs?</summary>\\n              <p class=\\\"small\\\">Occasionally — as educational tools to help understand patterns. Labs are optional and discussed transparently.</p>\\n            </details>\\n\\n            <details>\\n              <summary>Is this a substitute for medical care?</summary>\\n              <p class=\\\"small\\\">No. We collaborate with your clinicians when appropriate and will refer when specialized medical care is needed.</p>\\n            </details>\\n\\n            <details>\\n              <summary>Payment and insurance?</summary>\\n              <p class=\\\"small\\\">We offer clear pricing and can provide superbills for insurance reimbursement when relevant.</p>\\n            </details>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </aside>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <footer class=\\\"cta\\\" role=\\\"contentinfo\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <strong style=\\\"display:block\\\">Ready to connect?</strong>\\n        <p class=\\\"small\\\">Send a note, ask about a series, or request a consult. {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}} — serving {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}.</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <div style=\\\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;align-items:flex-end\\\">\\n        <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n        <a class=\\\"small\\\" href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none\\\">Or email: {{EMAIL}}</a>\\n      </div>\\n    </footer>\\n\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <script>\\n    (function(){\\n      var form = document.getElementById('contactForm');\\n      var msg = document.getElementById('formMsg');\\n      var clearBtn = document.getElementById('clearBtn');\\n      form.addEventListener('submit', function(e){\\n        e.preventDefault();\\n        // lightweight client-side validation\\n        var name = form.name.value.trim();\\n        var email = form.email.value.trim();\\n        if(!name || !email){ msg.textContent = 'Please include your name and email.'; return; }\\n        msg.textContent = 'Thanks — your message is noted. We typically reply within 3 business days.';\\n        form.reset();\\n      });\\n      clearBtn.addEventListener('click', function(){ form.reset(); msg.textContent=''; });\\n    })();\\n  </script>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"README.md\",\"content\":\"Contact page for holistic_medicine (zen_minimal / minimal_poetic voice)\\n\\nFiles in this chunk:\\n- contact.html — a lightweight, accessible contact & events page with inline SVG background and a contact form.\\n\\nPlaceholders to replace:\\n- {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — the clinic or practice name.\\n- {{TAGLINE}} — a short descriptive line.\\n- {{PHONE}} — business phone for click-to-call.\\n- {{EMAIL}} — contact email used in mailto links and the form.\\n- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}} — main call-to-action text (e.g., \\\"Book a consult\\\").\\n- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}} — URL for the primary CTA (e.g., booking link).\\n- {{CITY}} and {{STATE}} — practice location for footer.\\n- {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}} and {{CREDENTIALS}} — clinician name and credentials.\\n\\nNotes for integrators:\\n- The design intentionally avoids guaranteeing cures and emphasizes education, collaboration, and whole-person care.\\n- Events/series are described as educational; there are disclaimers about medical urgency and insurance.\\n- The contact form is client-side only (no backend). Hook form submission to your server or a third-party form endpoint as needed.\\n- Visuals come from CSS gradients and an inline SVG pattern. If you also include an external asset at assets/img/pattern.svg, the page can reference it later; the inline SVG ensures visual fidelity without external dependencies.\\n\\nAccessibility & responsiveness:\\n- Uses semantic elements, details/summary for FAQ, and keyboard-accessible controls.\\n- Responsive grid collapses to a single column below 880px.\\n\\nSuggested integrations:\\n- Wire up form POST to your booking CRM or use a serverless function to forward inquiries.\\n- Replace placeholder links with real pages: index.html, services.html, conditions.html, approach.html, pricing.html, about.html, book.html, contact.html.\\n\\nContent guidance:\\n- Keep messaging aligned with holistic medicine ethics: offer education, avoid promises of cures, and advise medical follow-up when necessary.\\n- Update events section to reflect real dates, capacities, and registration flows.\\n\\nSeed: 1855211329\\nSlug: holistic_medicine-2026-02-16T21-16-18-442Z-032\\nLayout family: zen_minimal\\nVoice: minimal_poetic\\nOffer model: events_series\\n\\nEnd of file.\"}\nBUNDLE_END"
